[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5499044638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118022#issuecomment-5499044638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118022","id":5499044638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR8TDHg","user":{"login":"BoraYalcinn","id":195580819,"node_id":"U_kgDOC6hTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195580819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn","html_url":"https://github.com/BoraYalcinn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T19:10:38Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T19:10:38Z","body":"I would love to look into this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5499044638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5499280982","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118022#issuecomment-5499280982","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118022","id":5499280982,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR8heVg","user":{"login":"BoraYalcinn","id":195580819,"node_id":"U_kgDOC6hTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195580819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn","html_url":"https://github.com/BoraYalcinn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T19:30:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T19:30:01Z","body":"I've looked into this. The root cause is in RendererSceneCull::_scene_cull (renderer_scene_cull.cpp): when lights are scored and assigned to per-mesh slots, only cull mask and bake mode are checked ,distance fade isn't considered, so fully faded-out lights still occupy slots. The fade check in rasterizer_scene_gles3.cpp happens later, after pairing is already done, so it doesn't free up the slot.\n\nFixing it there would need light_is_distance_fade_enabled / light_get_distance_fade_begin / light_get_distance_fade_length exposed on the common RendererLightStorage interface ,they currently exist only in the GLES3 and RD implementations as _FORCE_INLINE_. Making them virtual would add vtable calls in the inner culling loop, which might not be desirable there.\n\nIs exposing them on the interface the right approach, or would you prefer this handled differently?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5499280982/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5501383915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118022#issuecomment-5501383915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118022","id":5501383915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR-h06w","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T22:39:29Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T22:39:29Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.8.dev 74e99170e on Mobile and Compatibility:\n\n> Godot v4.8.dev (74e99170e) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (3840x2160 @ 240.02 Hz) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1656) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 63.55 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nForward+ is not affected by this issue. To test this with the MRP, decrease `rendering/limits/cluster_builder/max_clustered_elements` to `32` in the Project Settings, then duplicate the 16 lights twice (so you have 48 lights in total) and move them apart from each other. Lights will flicker if distance fade is disabled, but not when it's enabled.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5501383915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]